    "body": "closes https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/40381\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nThe zig test runner was still executing from the repo root. In contrast, the CMake runner  uses an isolated Xtest_xdg cwd with symlinks back to the code.\r\n\r\nThis means test that use repo-local zig-out/Xtest_tmpdir could trigger normal `:cd/shorten_fnames()` behavior and observe buffer names shortened to `zig-out/...`.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nUpdates the zig runner to match the CMake test environment by running functional/unit tests from Xtest_xdg and a similar runtime, src, test, and README.md symlinks there (just for POSIX).",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-01T17:07:37Z",
